## Changes

- Bump OpenWebUI image from `ghcr.io/open-webui/open-webui:0.12.0-slim` to `ghcr.io/open-webui/open-webui:0.12.5-slim`

## Validation

No sensitive files (no SSH scans, no leakable configs) included in this change.

## Deployment

ArgoCD will reconcile this change. Pods will be restarted via the `Recreate` strategy. Users must reconnect to their sessions.

Refer to upstream changelog: https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/releases/tag/v0.12.5
